  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k0030",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What a year! We’ve done a lot, created a lot and continued to push the needle of innovation. We ",
          "_key": "k0031"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "expanded our C-suite",
          "_key": "k0032"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", were ",
          "_key": "k0033"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0001"
          ],
          "text": "recognized as one of the best places to work",
          "_key": "k0034"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in Philadelphia (four years in a row!) and continued to work with some of the most talented partners and people. With that, we’re excited to highlight what we’ve been up to, reflect on what we’ve done and look toward an even more eventful and prosperous 2018 (this list isn’t comprehensive, just some of our favorites)!",
          "_key": "k0035"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0000",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/perspectives/o3-world-expands-c-suite-leadership-team-invests-in-agency-growth/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0001",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/perspectives/o3-world-recognized-as-best-places-to-work-in-philadelphia-4-years-in-a-row/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0036",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Things We Created",
          "_key": "k0037"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0038",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We combined IBM Watson’s Personality Insights API with IoT to create ",
          "_key": "k0039"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0002"
          ],
          "text": "O3 Moods",
          "_key": "k0040"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and transform the atmosphere of a room based on the user’s personality traits.",
          "_key": "k0041"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0002",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/labs/o3-moods/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0042",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Again, utilizing IBM Watson’s API, and an algorithm that analyzes different types of coffee roasts, ",
          "_key": "k0043"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0003"
          ],
          "text": "O3 Barista",
          "_key": "k0044"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " predicts coffee selections and provides personalized recommendations based on the user’s Twitter personality.",
          "_key": "k0045"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0003",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/labs/o3-barista/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0046",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In order to eliminate the indecisions about deciding what’s for lunch, we created ",
          "_key": "k0047"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0004"
          ],
          "text": "O3 Lunchbot",
          "_key": "k0048"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", an Alexa skill that simulates conversation with human users, to sort through menu items at local lunch spots.",
          "_key": "k0049"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0004",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/labs/o3-lunchbot/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0050",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Places We’ve Gone",
          "_key": "k0051"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0052",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "One of our favorite conferences of the year, ",
          "_key": "k0053"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0005"
          ],
          "text": "SXSW Interactive",
          "_key": "k0054"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " provided us with emerging technology insights and motivation to continue our work. We’re already looking forward to 2018!",
          "_key": "k0055"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0005",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.sxsw.com/festivals/interactive/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0056",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We showed some client love to Vertex at this year’s ",
          "_key": "k0057"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0006"
          ],
          "text": "#VertexExchange",
          "_key": "k0058"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". The conference took place in sunny San Diego — ",
          "_key": "k0059"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0007"
          ],
          "text": "check out this view",
          "_key": "k0060"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and ",
          "_key": "k0061"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0008"
          ],
          "text": "venue",
          "_key": "k0062"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "!",
          "_key": "k0063"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
