    {
      "_key": "k0064",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Two of our talented DPMs, Ashley C. and Ashley M., headed west to Las Vegas for a packed two days filled with presentations and lightning talks to discuss the craft of DPM. ",
          "_key": "k0065"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0009"
          ],
          "text": "Read the full recap of “Craft of DPM”",
          "_key": "k0066"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
