          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Justin Handler, Head of Accounts, spoke to the Digital Project Manager about how to be an invisible project manager. ",
          "_key": "k0097"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0019"
          ],
