          "marks": [],
          "text": " and our design team hosted a ",
          "_key": "k0121"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0025"
          ],
          "text": "design thinking workshop",
          "_key": "k0122"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " with Roxborough High School. We also hosted a 24-hour hackathon with ",
          "_key": "k0123"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0026"
          ],
          "text": "CodeDay Philly",
          "_key": "k0124"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Mentorship, y’all — it’s important.",
          "_key": "k0125"
        }
      ],
